    "Mok-yeon is the host of \"Within The Frame\", a current affairs program offering in-depth analysis on global and domestic issues. With a distinguished journalism career, she previously served as a main news anchor and as correspondents of the Presidential office, Parliament and Unification Ministry.": 1,
    "Dami Kim is a South Korean journalist and Chief Anchor at Arirang News. She leads the network’s primetime flagship program, News Center, airing weekdays at 8 PM Korea Standard Time.": 1,
    "Sooyoung Oh is currently the senior presidential correspondent for Arirang News, and has covered major news stories related to the Korean Peninsula, focusing on geopolitical, economic and defence-related issues.": 1,
    "Yoon Jung Min is a TV journalist/ Blue House Correspondent who was the anchor for Arirang News Center.": 1,
    "Bo-kyoung Kim is a defense correspondent who primarily covers North Korea and national security issues. She was the anchor of the 21 News program and the host of the in-depth analysis program Within the Frame.": 1,
    "Eum Ji-young is currently an anchor for Arirang News. Also as a business correspondent, she led the economics team at Arirang's Newscenter, mainly covering news from the Ministry of Economy and Finance and the Bank of Korea.": 1,
    "Presidential Office Correspondent": 1,
    "Bae Eun-ji is a foreign affairs correspondent for Arirang News.": 1,
    "Yoo-jin is the Presidential Office correspondent at Arirang News, delivering coverage of South Korea’s top office. Prior to joining the politics team, she served as the network’s culture correspondent and led the News Features team. She also hosted Arirang’s morning talk show NEWs GENERATION.": 1,
    "Lee Shi-hoo covers South Korean politics as a senior National Assembly correspondent. She is also a correspondent at the Ministry of the Interior and Safety.": 1
